    "name": "Final Bell: The Last AEW Unrestricted",
    "overview": "AEW Unrestricted signs off with hosts Ref Aubrey Edwards and Will Washington reflecting on the moments, memories, and matches that defined the official podcast of All Elite Wrestling.  They share behind-the-scenes stories from the show’s beginnings during the pandemic, how the podcast became a gateway for talent and fans alike, and what it meant to tell those stories week after week.  Aubrey and Will shout out the people who made it all happen, including Tony Schiavone and Tony Khan, while revisiting favorite interviews, unforgettable episodes, and the impact Unrestricted had on AEW’s growth.  Plus, they explain why now is the right time to close this chapter, what’s next for AEW podcasting, and why this isn’t goodbye...it’s just the end of this era.",
